      <Output>
        <StdOut>Given a projectile MT case named "source" with input "10 45 9.81"&#xD;
-&gt; done: ProjectileRangeSteps.GivenAProjectileMtCase("source", "10 45 9.81") (0.1s)&#xD;
And a projectile MT case named "follow-up" with input "20 45 9.81"&#xD;
-&gt; done: ProjectileRangeSteps.GivenAProjectileMtCase("follow-up", "20 45 9.81") (0.0s)&#xD;
When I run both projectile cases&#xD;
-&gt; done: ProjectileRangeSteps.WhenIRunBothProjectileCases() (3.8s)&#xD;
Then the projectile parsed value "range" of "follow-up" should exceed "source"&#xD;
-&gt; done: ProjectileRangeSteps.ThenProjectileParsedValueShouldExceed("range", "follow-up", "source") (0.0s)&#xD;
And the follow-up range should be approximately 4 times the source range&#xD;
-&gt; done: ProjectileRangeSteps.ThenFollowUpRangeRatio(4) (0.0s)</StdOut>
