      <Output>
        <StdOut>Given a source MT case with input value "5"&#xD;
-&gt; done: SystemLevelGeneratedFollowupSteps.GivenASourceMtCaseWithInputValue("5") (0.3s)&#xD;
And the MR transformation "ScalarMultiply" with parameter "multiplier" set to "3"&#xD;
-&gt; done: SystemLevelGeneratedFollowupSteps.GivenTheMrTransformationWithParameter("ScalarMultiply", "multiplier", "3") (0.0s)&#xD;
When I run source and the generated follow-up with program profile "example-cli"&#xD;
-&gt; done: SystemLevelGeneratedFollowupSteps.WhenIRunSourceAndTheGeneratedFollowUp("example-cli") (5.0s)&#xD;
Then the parsed output value "result" of the generated follow-up should be greater than the source&#xD;
-&gt; done: SystemLevelGeneratedFollowupSteps.ThenTheParsedOutputValueShouldBeGreater("result") (0.0s)</StdOut>
      </Output>
    </UnitTestResult>
