    <UnitTestResult executionId="b5fd530b-ec8b-4367-8d56-0aa92af3637c" testId="9eb51960-a204-457d-c2ee-faf5911a59aa" testName="Follow-up max_u exceeds source max_u after scaling initial amplitude" computerName="PC-20260416OPJH" duration="00:00:04.4051720" startTime="2026-06-15T10:23:07.6975327+08:00" endTime="2026-06-15T10:23:07.6975335+08:00" testType="13cdc9d9-ddb5-4fa4-a97d-d965ccfc6d4b" outcome="Passed" testListId="8c84fa94-04c1-424b-9868-57a2d4851a1d" relativeResultsDirectory="b5fd530b-ec8b-4367-8d56-0aa92af3637c">
      <Output>
        <StdOut>Given a heat-equation source case from "heat_equation/sample/gaussian.json"&#xD;
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.GivenAHeatEquationSourceCase("heat_equation/sam...") (0.5s)&#xD;
And a heat-equation transformation "ScaleAmplitude" with parameter "factor" set to "2"&#xD;
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.GivenTheHeatEquationTransformation("ScaleAmplitude", "factor", "2") (0.0s)&#xD;
When I run source and the generated follow-up through the heat-equation solver&#xD;
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.WhenIRunThroughTheHeatEquationSolver() (3.7s)&#xD;
Then the heat-equation parsed value "max_u" of the generated follow-up should be greater than the source&#xD;
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.ThenParsedValueShouldBeGreater("max_u") (0.0s)&#xD;
And the heat-equation follow-up max_u should be at least 1.95 times the source max_u&#xD;
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.ThenFollowUpMaxRatioFloor(1.95) (0.0s)&#xD;
And the heat-equation follow-up max_u should be at most 2.05 times the source max_u&#xD;
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.ThenFollowUpMaxRatioCeiling(2.05) (0.0s)</StdOut>
      </Output>
    </UnitTestResult>
